<https://purl.eu/doc/applicationprofile/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs/ontwerpstandaard/toolchain4#HoppincolumnShape> a shacl:NodeShape;
  rdfs:label "HoppinColumn"@en;
  <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> """Intended to indicate that a Transport hub is a Hoppin point and/or to inform about the transport possibilities offered there.
