    rdfs:label "includes"@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example, public transport in Brussels offered by STIB consists of a number of metro lines, e.g. line 5 Erasmus-Herman-Debroux, or a MAAS provider integrates several services, e.g. public transport and shared transport."@en;
    rdfs:comment "More specific Mobility Services that make up the Mobility Service."@en;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://purl.eu/doc/applicationprofile/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs/ontwerpstandaard/toolchain4#Mobilityservice.Includes>;
